WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.640
Solana is a network of computers that keeps
a shared record of transfers and app actions.

00:00:06.792 --> 00:00:10.432
Here, a parent approves a transfer in a wallet app.

00:00:11.152 --> 00:00:15.652
The wallet signs the request using a private key the parent controls.

00:00:15.792 --> 00:00:21.192
Computers check the signature and rules,
then agree on updates to the shared record.

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:24.353
Once recorded, we can look up the transfer.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.380
Network fees are paid in SOL, Solana's own token.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.100
Solana is the network.

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.100
SOL is the token.
